{
 "esm": "2.0.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cice_dynamics",
  "description": "CICE sea-ice dynamics (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the B-grid momentum balance and the classic-EVP stress evolution of the default kdyn = 1 (EVP) configuration of cesm3_cice6_6_3_22, lowered onto the traced 3x5 subdomain (N_I = 3 T cells along x, N_J = 5 along y) of the stage-1 dump with the EarthSciDiscretizations CICE B-grid rules (grids/cice_bgrid): strain_rates_divu/tension/shear lower D(uvel,x)+D(vvel,y), D(uvel,x)-D(vvel,y), D(uvel,y)+D(vvel,x) to the four-corner (NE/NW/SW/SE) staggered strain-rate combinations of strain_rates (ice_dyn_shared.F90:2094-2175), and stress_divergence_strintx/strinty lower D(sigma11,x)+D(sigma12,y) and D(sigma12,x)+D(sigma22,y) to the B-grid stress integrals strintx/strinty = uarear*(str1 - str2 + str3 - str4) of stepu (ice_dyn_evp.F90:1698-1765, 958-961). The Fortran integrates the momentum equation in stepu (ice_dyn_shared.F90:923-964) inside the ndte = 120 subcycles of evp (ice_dyn_evp.F90:259-1447), solving implicitly with the intermediates vrel = aiX*rhow*Cw*|u_ocn - u| (F90:931-932), taux/tauy = vrel*waterx/y with the cosw/sinw rotation of the ocean velocity (F90:817-818; the default cosw = 1, sinw = 0; the full coupled form is carried here as in dyn_finish, F90:1345-1348), Cb = TbU/(|u| + u0) (F90:937), cca = (brlx + revp)*Umassdti + vrel*cosw + Cb, ccb = fm + sign(1,fm)*vrel*sinw, ab2 = cca^2 + ccb^2, cc1/cc2 (F90:949-956) and the update uvel = (cca*cc1 + ccb*cc2)/ab2, vvel = (cca*cc2 - ccb*cc1)/ab2 (F90:958-959); the model writes the continuous limit m*du/dt = tau_a + tau_tilt + tau_o + div(sigma) - Cb*u + m*f*khat x u instead (the implicit-solve algebra cca/ccb/ab2/cc1/cc2 is solver machinery, documented here rather than transcribed). The stress evolution: the classic-EVP under-relaxed maps stressp_new = (stressp*(1-arlx1i*revp) + arlx1i*(zetax2*divu - rep_prs))*denom1 etc. (stress, ice_dyn_evp.F90:1584-1609) with arlx = 2*elasticDamp*ndte, arlx1i = 1/arlx, brlx = ndte, denom1 = 1/(1+arlx1i) for revised_evp = .false. (set_evp_parameters, ice_dyn_shared.F90:451-484), which relax toward the plastic targets zetax2*divu - rep_prs, etax2*tension, 0.5*etax2*shear with the subcycle time step dt/ndte, i.e. the continuous relaxation d(sigma)/dt = (sigma_target - sigma)/Td with Td = 2*elasticDamp*dt (elasticDamp = 0.36 default); here the four-corner staggered stresses stressp_1..4 of the Fortran are carried per corner on the corner axis, and the stressp/stressm/stress12 unknowns ARE the four-corner fields of the dump (newp/newm/new12 ksub1), so no corner collapse is needed. The strain rates of strain_rates are area-weighted (the Fortran comment 'NOTE these are actually strain rates * area (m^2/s)', F90:2119-2120), so divu/tension/shear/Delta carry units m^2/s and the viscosities zetax2 = (1+Ktens)*tmpcalc, etax2 = epp2i*zetax2 with tmpcalc = capping*strength/max(Delta, DminArea) + (1-capping)*strength/(Delta + DminArea) (visc_replpress, ice_dyn_shared.F90:2467-2471, DminArea = DminTarea = deltaminEVP*dxT*dyT) carry kg/(m^2 s); rep_prs = (1-Ktens)*tmpcalc*Delta (F90:2470) is N/m. The ice strength P is the run's kstrength = 1 Rothrock (1975) potential-energy form (icepack_ice_strength, icepack_mechred.F90:1660-1712, with the D-class krdg_partic = krdg_redist = 1 and mu_rdg = 4): the open-water fraction aice0 = 1 - aice, the cumulative distribution Gsum and its normalization (ridge_itd, F90:848-889), the exponential participation functions apartic(0..ncat) (F90:919-934), the exponential redistribution hrmin/hrexp/krdg (F90:1004-1010), aksum (F90:1031-1036) and strength = Cf*Cp*sum_n(apartic*dh2rdg)/aksum (F90:1697-1710), evaluated per T cell from the transported aicen/vicen and pinned against cice_ice_strength.csv at all 15 traced cells (rel 1e-12); the ridge redistribution itself (ridge_shift of area/volume/enthalpy between categories) remains outside this model. The ocean-ice stress magnitude uses the dump's aiX = 1 - exp(-Cb_ocn*(1-aice)) (the cap's aice_init-based concentration, ice_dyn_shared.F90:928-930; aiX is a dump parameter here, NOT derived from aicen -- the 4-cell U-point average misses up to 2.6e-3 of the cap value, see README.md). The coupled momentum + stress ODEs are integrated over one EVP subcycle (dte = 30 s) in the test cice_dynamics_evp_subcycle_integrated, with strairx/strairy recovered from the momentum dump's forcex/forcey, and the interior stresses asserted against the dumped subcycle update with per-assertion tolerances of 0.6x the dumped increment (scheme-difference tolerances: the model's continuous momentum ODE is not the Fortran's semi-implicit pseudo-time stepu, so the velocities are not asserted; the cap test cice_coupling.esm pins the stepu partials vrel*waterx/y). Import contract: the model declares the N_I/N_J/NCAT metaparameters and i/j/corner/ncat index sets locally (the esm CLI 0.4.0/0.6.0 rejects faq-range metaparameter references when a template library is imported with bindings -- RangeSpec round-trip parse bug of the esm CLI), and imports the five B-grid lowering rules by reference from the EarthSciDiscretizations library (${ESD_ROOT} must be set to that repo's checkout when running the tests). The free-name contract of grid.esm: the model supplies dxT, dyT, cxp, cyp, cxm, cym, dxhy, dyhx, HTE, HTN, uarear as its own [i,j] parameters (the pin test overrides them from the dump; the metric derivations and their F90:413-437, 682-703 citations live in grids/cice_bgrid/grid.esm).",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
   "cryosphere",
   "sea-ice",
   "cice",
   "dynamics",
   "evp",
   "b-grid",
   "cesm"
  ],
  "created": "2026-11-01T00:00:00Z",
  "authors": [
   "EqESM project contributors"
  ],
  "references": [
   {
    "citation": "Hunke, E. C., Allard, R., Bailey, D. A., Blain, P., Craig, A., Dupont, F., ... & Roberts, A. F. (2023). CICE-Consortium Icepack v1.2.4 and CICE v6.3.22: documentation and user's guide. Los Alamos National Laboratory (LA-UR-23-31851)."
   },
   {
    "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CESM: CICE sea-ice source (cesm3_cice6_6_3_22) - ice_dyn_shared.F90, ice_dyn_evp.F90, icepack_mechred.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
    "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CESM"
   },
   {
    "citation": "EarthSciModels - the authoritative .esm corpus this component lives in.",
    "url": "https://github.com/EarthSciML/EarthSciModels"
   }
  ]
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "N_I": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 3,
   "description": "number of T cells along the B-grid x axis of the traced subdomain (global cells 2..4 of the stage-1 dump), [-]"
  },
  "N_J": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 5,
   "description": "number of T cells along the B-grid y axis (global cells 4..8 of the dump), [-]"
  },
  "NCAT": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 5,
   "description": "number of ice thickness categories (namelist ncat = 5), [-]"
  }
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "i": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_I"
  },
  "j": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_J"
  },
  "corner": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": 4
  },
  "ncat": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "NCAT"
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "Dynamics": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./cice_templates.esm"
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/cice_bgrid/rules/strain_rates_divu.esm"
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/cice_bgrid/rules/strain_rates_tension.esm"
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/cice_bgrid/rules/strain_rates_shear.esm"
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/cice_bgrid/rules/stress_divergence_strintx.esm"
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/cice_bgrid/rules/stress_divergence_strinty.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "uvel": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "x-component of the ice velocity at the U points (the NE corners of the T cells; the momentum state of stepu, ice_dyn_evp.F90), [m/s]"
    },
    "vvel": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "y-component of the ice velocity at the U points, the momentum state, [m/s]"
    },
    "stressp": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "EVP stress sum stressp = sigma11 + sigma22 at the four cell corners (the Fortran's stressp_1..4 of the stress dump, newp ksub1), the classic-EVP relaxation state, [N/m]"
    },
    "stressm": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "EVP stress difference stressm = sigma11 - sigma22 at the four corners (newm ksub1), the classic-EVP relaxation state, [N/m]"
    },
    "stress12": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "EVP shear stress stress12 = sigma12 at the four corners (new12 ksub1), the classic-EVP relaxation state, [N/m]"
    },
    "sigma11": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "normal stress component sigma11 = (stressp + stressm)/2 at the four corners, [N/m]"
    },
    "sigma22": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "normal stress component sigma22 = (stressp - stressm)/2, [N/m]"
    },
    "sigma12": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "shear stress component sigma12 = stress12, [N/m]"
    },
    "strintx": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "x divergence of the internal stress tensor at the U points, the rewrite target strintx = D(sigma11,x) + D(sigma12,y) lowered by the stress_divergence_strintx rule to strintx = uarear*(str1 - str2 + str3 - str4) of stepu (ice_dyn_evp.F90:1698-1765, 958-961), [N/m2]"
    },
    "strinty": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "y divergence of the internal stress tensor, the rewrite target strinty = D(sigma12,x) + D(sigma22,y) (strinty = uarear*(str5 - str6 + str7 - str8), F90:959-961), [N/m2]"
    },
    "divu": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "m^2/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "strain-rate divergence divu = D(u,x) + D(v,y) at the four corners, the rewrite target of the strain_rates_divu rule (strain_rates, ice_dyn_shared.F90:2094-2105; the Fortran corner values are area-weighted: 'NOTE these are actually strain rates * area (m^2/s)', F90:2119-2120), [m2/s]"
    },
    "tension": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "m^2/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "tension strain rate tension = D(u,x) - D(v,y) at the four corners (strain_rates, F90:2108-2119), area-weighted, [m2/s]"
    },
    "shear": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "m^2/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "shearing strain rate shear = D(u,y) + D(v,x) = 2*e12 at the four corners (strain_rates, F90:2122-2133), area-weighted, [m2/s]"
    },
    "Delta": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "m^2/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "strain-rate invariant of the elliptical yield curve, Delta = sqrt(divu^2 + e_factor*(tension^2 + shear^2)) (strain_rates, F90:2156-2159), area-weighted, [m2/s]"
    },
    "aice0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "open-water area fraction aice0 = 1 - aice (aggregate_area / icepack_aggregate, the aice0 argument of icepack_ice_strength and ridge_itd, icepack_mechred.F90:1660-1690; the stage-1 cice_ice_strength.csv aice0 column equals 1 - aice to 1e-17 at every traced cell), [-]"
    },
    "gsum0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "open-water term of the ridge cumulative distribution Gsum(0) = aice0 for aice0 > puny else 0 (ridge_itd, icepack_mechred.F90:851-855), [-]"
    },
    "gsum": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "cumulative ice-area part of the ridge distribution sum_{m<=n} aicen(m) for aicen(m) > puny (ridge_itd, icepack_mechred.F90:858-880; Gsum(n) = gsum0 + gsum(n)), [-]"
    },
    "gsum_total": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "total participating area Gsum(ncat) = gsum0 + sum_n aicen(n) (F90:884), [-]"
    },
    "work": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "normalization work = 1/Gsum(ncat) for Gsum(ncat) > 0, else 0 (F90:884-885), [-]"
    },
    "gsum_norm": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "normalized cumulative distribution Gsum(n)*work (F90:886-888), [-]"
    },
    "gsum_prev_norm": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "normalized cumulative distribution of the previous category Gsum(n-1)*work = (Gsum(n) - aicen(n))*work (F90:886-888, 929-933; Gsum(0) = gsum0), [-]"
    },
    "apartic0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "open-water participation function apartic(0) = (1 - exp(-Gsum(0)/astar))/(1 - exp(-1/astar)) (ridge_itd krdg_partic = 1, icepack_mechred.F90:919-934, astar = 0.05), [-]"
    },
    "apartic": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "per-category participation function apartic(n) = [exp(-Gsum(n-1)/astar) - exp(-Gsum(n)/astar)]/(1 - exp(-1/astar)) (F90:919-934), [-]"
    },
    "hi_rdg": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "per-category thickness of the ridging ice hi = max(vicen/aicen, puny) for aicen > puny else 0 (F90:1006-1007), [m]"
    },
    "hrmin": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "per-category minimum ridge thickness hrmin = min(2*hi, hi + maxraft), maxraft = 1 m (krdg_redist = 1, F90:1008), [m]"
    },
    "hrexp": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "per-category ridge e-folding thickness hrexp = mu_rdg*sqrt(hi), mu_rdg = 4 m^(1/2) (D-class namelist; F90:1009), [m]"
    },
    "krdg": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "mean ridge thickness over the thickness of the ridging ice krdg = (hrmin + hrexp)/hi, else the krdg = 1 default (F90:863, 1010), [-]"
    },
    "aksum": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "net ice area removed over the total area participating aksum = apartic(0) + sum_n apartic(n)*(1 - 1/krdg(n)) (F90:1031-1036), [-]"
    },
    "strength": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice strength P of the D-class kstrength = 1 Rothrock (1975) potential-energy formulation with the exponential participation and redistribution functions krdg_partic = krdg_redist = 1 (icepack_ice_strength, icepack_mechred.F90:1660-1712): strength = Cf*Cp*sum_n(apartic(n)*dh2rdg(n))/aksum with dh2rdg = -hi^2 + (hrmin^2 + 2*hrmin*hrexp + 2*hrexp^2)/krdg, Cf = 17 (icepack_parameters.F90:261), Cp = (gravit/2)*(rhow - rhoi)*rhoi/rhow (F90:2814); the same law as the IceCap Rothrock probe of cice_coupling.esm, here evaluated per T cell from the transported aicen/vicen, and pinned against cice_ice_strength.csv at all 15 traced cells. The Hibler (1979) kstrength = 0 form P = Pstar*vice*exp(-Cstar*(1-aice)) stays available as the ice_strength_hibler template but is not the run's configuration, [N/m]"
    },
    "tmpcalc": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(m^2 s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "shared scale of the viscosities and replacement pressure at the four corners: capping*strength/max(Delta, DminTarea) + (1-capping)*strength/(Delta + DminTarea) (visc_replpress, ice_dyn_shared.F90:2467-2468, applied per corner with the T-cell strength and DminTarea), [kg/(m2 s)]"
    },
    "zetax2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(m^2 s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "twice the bulk viscosity zetax2 = (1+Ktens)*tmpcalc (visc_replpress, F90:2469), [kg/(m2 s)]"
    },
    "etax2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(m^2 s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "twice the shear viscosity etax2 = epp2i*zetax2 (visc_replpress, F90:2471), [kg/(m2 s)]"
    },
    "rep_prs": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "replacement pressure rep_prs = (1-Ktens)*tmpcalc*Delta (visc_replpress, F90:2470), [N/m]"
    },
    "stressp_target": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "plastic target of stressp, zetax2*divu - rep_prs (the arlx1i-weighted term of the classic-EVP update, stress, ice_dyn_evp.F90:1587), [N/m]"
    },
    "stressm_target": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "plastic target of stressm, etax2*tension (ice_dyn_evp.F90:1595), [N/m]"
    },
    "stress12_target": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "corner"
     ],
     "units": "N/m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "plastic target of stress12, 0.5*etax2*shear (the p5 factor of ice_dyn_evp.F90:1603), [N/m]"
    },
    "Td": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "classic-EVP stress relaxation time Td = 2*elasticDamp*dt (the continuous limit of the under-relaxed subcycle map: arlx1i = 1/(2*elasticDamp*ndte) per subcycle of length dt/ndte), [s]"
    },
    "aice": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "total ice concentration aice = sum_ncat aicen (the aice argument of icepack_ice_strength, ice_dyn_evp.F90:543), [-]"
    },
    "vice": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "total ice volume per unit area vice = sum_ncat vicen, [m]"
    },
    "vsno": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "total snow volume per unit area vsno = sum_ncat vsnon, [m]"
    },
    "m": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "kg/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice mass per unit area Tmass = rhoi*vice + rhos*vsno (dyn_prep1, ice_dyn_shared.F90:540), [kg/m2]"
    },
    "vrel": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(m^2 s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "relative ocean-ice current times the drag: vrel = aiX*rhow*Cw*|u_ocn - uvel| (stepu, ice_dyn_shared.F90:931-932; the aiX concentration of the cap's ocean-ice stress, a dump parameter), [kg/(m2 s)]"
    },
    "taux": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "x ocean-ice stress of the momentum balance, the full coupled form vrel*((uocn-uvel)*cosw - (vocn-vvel)*sinw*sign(1,fm)) (dyn_finish, F90:1345-1348); stepu carries only the vrel*waterx partial term (F90:933-934), pinned in the cap test cice_coupling.esm, [N/m2]"
    },
    "tauy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "y ocean-ice stress, vrel*((vocn-vvel)*cosw + (uocn-uvel)*sinw*sign(1,fm)) (dyn_finish, F90:1347-1348), [N/m2]"
    },
    "Cb": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "kg/(m^2 s)",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "linear seabed (basal) stress coefficient Cb = TbU/(|uvel| + u0) (stepu, ice_dyn_shared.F90:937), [kg/(m2 s)]"
    },
    "strtltx": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "stress due to the sea-surface slope, strtltx = -gravit*m*ss_tltx under ssh_stress = 'coupled' (dyn_prep2, ice_dyn_shared.F90:826), [N/m2]"
    },
    "strtlty": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "stress due to the sea-surface slope, strtlty = -gravit*m*ss_tlty (F90:827), [N/m2]"
    },
    "DminTarea": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m^2/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "minimum strain-rate area product DminTarea = deltaminEVP*dxT*dyT (the DminArea of visc_replpress, ice_dyn_shared.F90:2467; deltaminEVP = 1e-11 s^-1, ice_init.F90:454), [m2/s]"
    },
    "aicen": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice area fraction per category (the coupled ice state, wired from the transport model in the assembly), [-]"
    },
    "vicen": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ice volume per unit grid-cell area per category (wired from the transport model), [m]"
    },
    "vsnon": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j",
      "ncat"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "snow volume per unit grid-cell area per category (wired from the transport model), [m]"
    },
    "strairx": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "x wind stress on ice (strairx, computed by the assembly's atmo scheme and mapped T->U), [N/m2]"
    },
    "strairy": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "y wind stress on ice, [N/m2]"
    },
    "uocn": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ocean surface current, x direction at the U points (cap So_u), [m/s]"
    },
    "vocn": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "ocean surface current, y direction at the U points (cap So_v), [m/s]"
    },
    "ss_tltx": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "x sea-surface slope for the coupled tilt stress (cap So_dhdx), [-]"
    },
    "ss_tlty": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "y sea-surface slope for the coupled tilt stress (cap So_dhdy), [-]"
    },
    "fcor": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1/s",
     "default": 0.0001,
     "description": "Coriolis parameter 2*Omega*sin(latitude) at the U points (fcor, ice_dyn_shared.F90:814), [1/s]"
    },
    "hemis": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "hemisphere factor sign(1,fm) of the ocean-stress rotation: +1 where the Coriolis parameter fm is positive, -1 where negative (stepu, ice_dyn_shared.F90:944), [-]"
    },
    "TbU": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "seabed stress factor (nonzero only over landfast-ice grounding zones; seabed_stress_factor_LKD/prob, ice_dyn_shared.F90:1384-1681), [N/m2]"
    },
    "aiX": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "the concentration factor of the ocean-ice stress, aiX = 1 - exp(-Cb_ocn*(1-aice_init)) evaluated by the cap with the ENTRY aice (the dump's aiX column; NOT derived from the model's aicen -- the 4-cell U-point average misses up to 2.6e-3 of the cap value, see README.md), [-]"
    },
    "dxT": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "width of the T cell through the middle (the free-name metric of the cice_bgrid rules; the pin test overrides it from the stress-dump corner-1 columns), [m]"
    },
    "dyT": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "height of the T cell through the middle, [m]"
    },
    "cxp": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "strain-rate metric coefficient cxp = 1.5*HTN(i,j) - 0.5*HTN(i,j-1) (ice_dyn_shared.F90:435), [m]"
    },
    "cyp": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "strain-rate metric coefficient cyp = 1.5*HTE(i,j) - 0.5*HTE(i-1,j) (F90:434), [m]"
    },
    "cxm": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "strain-rate metric coefficient cxm = -(1.5*HTN(i,j-1) - 0.5*HTN(i,j)) (F90:437), [m]"
    },
    "cym": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "strain-rate metric coefficient cym = -(1.5*HTE(i-1,j) - 0.5*HTE(i,j)) (F90:436), [m]"
    },
    "dxhy": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "half the east-edge-length difference dxhy = 0.5*(HTE(i,j) - HTE(i-1,j)) (F90:413-414), [m]"
    },
    "dyhx": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "half the north-edge-length difference dyhx = 0.5*(HTN(i,j) - HTN(i,j-1)) (F90:415-416), [m]"
    },
    "HTE": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "east edge length of the T cell (the free-name metric of the stress-divergence rules; the pin test overrides the derived values HTE = (3*cyp - cym)/4 from the dump metrics), [m]"
    },
    "HTN": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "north edge length of the T cell (HTN = (3*cxp - cxm)/4), [m]"
    },
    "uarear": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "shape": [
      "i",
      "j"
     ],
     "units": "1/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "inverse U-cell area (the 1/uarea of the momentum dump; uarea = 0.25*sum of the four surrounding tarea, ice_grid.F90:703), [1/m2]"
    },
    "Cw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.00536,
     "description": "ocean-ice neutral drag coefficient Cdn_ocn (namelist dragio = 0.00536 default, icepack_parameters.F90:266), [-]"
    },
    "gravit": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s^2",
     "default": 9.80616,
     "description": "gravitational acceleration (gravit, icepack_parameters.F90:56), [m/s2]"
    },
    "dt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 3600.0,
     "description": "dynamics timestep (namelist dt; the EVP subcycles ndte = 120 times per step), [s]"
    },
    "elasticDamp": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.36,
     "description": "elastic damping parameter of the EVP scheme (namelist elasticDamp = 0.36), [-]"
    },
    "ndte": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 120.0,
     "description": "number of EVP subcycles per dynamics step (namelist ndte = 120), [-]"
    },
    "e_plasticpot": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 2.0,
     "description": "ratio of the major to minor axes of the elliptical plastic potential (namelist e_plasticpot = 2; the folded constants epp2i = 1/e_plasticpot^2 and e_factor are carried separately), [-]"
    },
    "e_yieldcurve": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 2.0,
     "description": "ratio of the major to minor axes of the elliptical yield curve (namelist e_yieldcurve = 2), [-]"
    },
    "capping": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "1 for the capped viscosity form strength/max(Delta, DminArea), 0 for strength/(Delta + DminArea) (namelist capping = 1), [-]"
    },
    "Ktens": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "tensile strength coefficient (namelist Ktens = 0, the Lemieux et al. 2016 tensile strength is off), [-]"
    },
    "cosw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "cosine of the ocean-current rotation angle (namelist cosw = 1, no rotation), [-]"
    },
    "sinw": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "sine of the ocean-current rotation angle (namelist sinw = 0), [-]"
    },
    "u0": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 5e-05,
     "description": "velocity floor in the seabed stress denominator (namelist u0 = 5e-5 m/s), [m/s]"
    },
    "deltaminEVP": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1/s",
     "default": 1e-11,
     "description": "minimum strain rate for the EVP viscosities (deltaminEVP = 1e-11 s^-1, ice_init.F90:454; DminTarea = deltaminEVP*tarea), [1/s]"
    },
    "arlx": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 86.4,
     "description": "classic-EVP elastic parameter arlx = 2*elasticDamp*ndte = 86.4 (set_evp_parameters, ice_dyn_shared.F90:474-475), [-]"
    },
    "arlx1i": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.011574074074074073,
     "description": "inverse elastic parameter arlx1i = 1/arlx = 1/86.4 (set_evp_parameters, F90:476), [-]"
    },
    "brlx": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 120.0,
     "description": "classic-EVP parameter brlx = ndte = 120 (set_evp_parameters, F90:477), [-]"
    },
    "denom1": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.988558352402746,
     "description": "classic-EVP denominator denom1 = 1/(1+arlx1i) = 86.4/87.4 (set_evp_parameters, F90:478), [-]"
    },
    "epp2i": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.25,
     "description": "inverse plastic-potential eccentricity squared epp2i = 1/e_plasticpot^2 = 0.25 (set_evp_parameters, F90:464), [-]"
    },
    "e_factor": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.25,
     "description": "yield-curve factor of the Delta invariant e_factor = e_yieldcurve^2/e_plasticpot^4 = 0.25 (set_evp_parameters, F90:465), [-]"
    }
